- op: discuss  # dadb
  at: '2026-03-06T19:48:57Z'  # dadb
  by: agent  # dadb
  actor: jgstern_agent  # dadb
  clock: 6  # dadb
  nonce: dadb  # dadb
  message: "The same pattern (build target → main function disconnected) could affect: (1) Python: pyproject.toml console_scripts/gui_scripts entry points → __main__.py or main() functions, (2) Java/Kotlin: Maven pom.xml <mainClass> or Gradle application { mainClass } → main() methods, (3) C#: .csproj <StartupObject> → Program.Main(). Go is not affected (package main + func main() is direct, no build manifest indirection). Currently only Cargo [[bin]] (Rust) and npm bin (JS/TS) emit defines_target edges. The others would need similar support in their config file analyzers."  # dadb
- op: discuss  # 5209
  at: '2026-03-06T23:06:03Z'  # 5209
